---
globs:
  - "artifacts/**/*.json"
  - "workflow/**/*.md"
alwaysApply: true
---

An approval is valid only for the exact content hash, selected variant, asset IDs, Page ID, and any per-post quality override shown to the reviewer. The chat draft must be materialized into the local review profile before the preview and approval dialog. Any edit creates a new version and invalidates approval. AI may prepare `NEEDS_HUMAN_APPROVAL`; only an authenticated reviewer/backend may create `APPROVED`. In chat mode, the authenticated human's explicit `AskQuestion` selection (or explicit text fallback) is recorded verbatim; the agent must never infer approval or choose option 1.
